Comment: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:08.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}兎にも角にも、笑顔で！
Comment: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:14.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}「鏡よ鏡。ちゃんと笑えてる？」
Comment: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:26.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}昔からの言い付けを馬鹿みたいに守ってる
Comment: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:32.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}必要とされたくて　誰かのために笑った
Comment: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:41.62,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}信じてきた仮面を私のためにサヨナラ
Comment: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:47.44,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}笑う理由なんて　探すものじゃなくて
Comment: 1,0:22:41.74,0:22:47.44,EDJP-furi,start_idx=3,0,587,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}ワ ケ
Comment: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:53.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}あくびするように自然とそこにあった
Comment: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:59.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}祈るみたいに時を超えてきた
Comment: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:05.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}二つの運命が答え教えてくれた
Comment: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:09.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}やっと会えたね。
Comment: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:17.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}私が笑う本当の理由は
Comment: 1,0:23:12.07,0:23:17.89,EDJP-furi,start_idx=8,335,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}ワ ケ
Comment: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:25.02,EDJP,fad_end=750,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,750)}他の誰でもない、君でした。
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDCN-------------------
Comment: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:08.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}无论如何都要面带笑容！
Comment: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:14.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}「魔镜啊魔镜  我有好好笑着吗？」
Comment: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:26.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}傻傻地遵守着好久以前的指示
Comment: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:32.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}希望被人需要  为了某人而笑
Comment: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:41.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}为了我而向曾经深信的面具告别
Comment: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:47.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}笑的理由并非寻求而得
Comment: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:53.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}而是像打哈欠一样自然出现
Comment: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:59.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}如祈愿般超越时光而来
Comment: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:05.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}两个命运给出了答案
Comment: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:09.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}总算遇见你了。
Comment: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:17.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,200)}我之所以笑的真正理由
Comment: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:25.02,EDCN,fad_end=750,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur0.5\fad(100,750)}别无他人  正是因为你。
